## 9. CLIENT BEHAVIOUR TO PRESERVE

- **Offline Login (3 days)** when the user ticks the box: port `offCredSave` / `offCredGet` / `offCredDelete` / `offCredPurge` from `script.js` exactly (do not store the plain password); offline session can view cached data only; "नेट आले आहे — पुन्हा Login करा" when saving is needed. Logout wipes it (unless session just expired).
- **Stale-while-revalidate cache** in `localStorage` (prefix `sgs_swr:` + app version + username): roster of a teacher 3 days, other 24 h, max 300 KB per entry / 1 MB total; **never cache** anything matching `fee|thakbaki|arrear|payment|receipt`. Show an offline/"ताजी माहिती" bar when stale.
- **Pending Saves** queue for saves made without internet, retried automatically when online (see the मदत page section "Pending Saves").
- **Client error reporting** (`logClientErrors`): window.onerror + unhandledrejection, scrubbed of phone numbers, Reg No, e-mail and URL queries; rate limited (5/min, 30/session, queue key `sgs_errq_v1`, max 50).
- **Student cache** (`getAll`) used by Search/Profile/Report; clear it after any save that changes students or photo links.
- **Warm-up `ping`** before login ("🔄 प्रथम शाळेशी जोडा"), exactly like `script.js`.
- **WhatsApp / call links:** `https://wa.me/91<10-digit>?text=...` and `tel:` for parents and teachers; Marathi message templates are in `script.js`.
- Dates are `dd-mm-yyyy` in the UI; server returns formatted DOB/admission dates.

